@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki.integration"

Feature:  Dossiera To Koroneiki Integration
	Testing to assure dossiera to koroneiki integration works properly.

Teardown:
	* I wait for "10" seconds
	* I tear down the external links for the product "A Liferay DXP Product" on koroneiki with the following entity id values
	| A Liferay DXP Product |
	* I tear down the external links for the product "Platinum Subscription" on koroneiki with the following entity id values
	| Platinum Subscription |
	* I tear down the external links for the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" on koroneiki with the following entity id values
	| ${staticDossieraAccountKey}   |
	| ${staticSalesforceProjectKey} |
	* I tear down the product purchases on koroneiki made by the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" for the following products
	| A Liferay DXP Product |
	| Platinum Subscription |
	* I tear down the products on koroneiki with the following names
	| A Liferay DXP Product |
	| Platinum Subscription |
	* I tear down the contact roles on koroneiki with the following names
	| Liferay Account Customer Role |
 	* I tear down the contacts on koroneiki with the following email addresses
	| pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following names
	| Korpro - ${staticCompanyName} |
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following "Code" values
	| KORPROKORPRO |

Scenario: Create entities
	Testing the ability to create a project in Dossiera and verifying that the respective entities get sent to and created in Koroneiki

	Given I generate several static variables for Provisioning
	And I generate a provisioning company name
	And I generate a provisioning project name
	And I publish a project with no partner RabbitMQ message on sandbox with routing key "dossiera.provisioning.create" with the following values
	| Account Name                           | Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}              |
	| Address City                           | Diamond Bar                                |
	| Address Country                        | United States                              |
	| Address Postal Code                    | 91765                                      |
	| Address Region                         | California                                 |
	| Address Street                         | 456 Fake Street                            |
	| Contact Email Address                  | pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken       |
	| Contact First Name                     | PRO                                        |
	| Contact Last Name                      | Koroneiki1                                 |
	| Contact Role                           | Liferay Account Customer Role              |
	| Dossiera Account Key                   | ${staticDossieraAccountKey}                |
	| Dossiera Address Key 1                 | ${staticDossieraAddressKey1}               |
	| Dossiera Address Key 2                 | ${staticDossieraAddressKey2}               |
	| Dossiera Contact Key                   | ${staticDossieraContactKey}                |
	| Dossiera Project Key                   | ${staticDossieraProjectKey}                |
	| End Day                                | ${staticEndDay}                            |
	| End Month                              | ${staticEndMonth}                          |
	| End Year                               | ${staticEndYear}                           |
	| Industry                               | Automotive                                 |
	| Owner Email Address                    | pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken       |
	| Owner First Name                       | PRO                                        |
	| Owner Last Name                        | Koroneiki1                                 |
	| Partner First Line Support             | false                                      |
	| Product Type                           | New                                        |
	| Product Name                           | A Liferay DXP Product                      |
	| Project Name                           | Korpro - ${staticProjectName}              |
	| Renewal                                | false                                      |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Key             | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityKey}          |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Line Item Key 1 | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityLineItemKey1} |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Line Item Key 2 | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityLineItemKey2} |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Sold By         | Liferay US                                 |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Stage Name      | Closed Won                                 |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Territory       | United States                              |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Type            | New Business                               |
	| Salesforce Owner User Key              | ${staticSalesforceOwnerUserKey}            |
	| Salesforce Project Key                 | ${staticSalesforceProjectKey}              |
	| Start Day                              | ${staticStartDay}                          |
	| Start Month                            | ${staticStartMonth}                        |
	| Start Year                             | ${staticStartYear}                         |
	| Subscription Level                     | Platinum                                   |
	| Version Number                         | 7.1                                        |
	And I wait for "10" seconds
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki account with the name "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" and the following values
	| Code                  | KORPROKORPRO                         |
	| Contact Email Address | pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Name                  | Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}        |
	| Region                | United States                        |
	| Status                | Approved                             |
	And I should be able to view a postal address on koroneiki for the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" with the street address "456 Fake Street" with the following values
	| Country               | United States   |
	| Locality              | Diamond Bar     |
	| Region                | California      |
	| Postal Code           | 91765           |
	| Street Address Line 1 | 456 Fake Street |
	And the external link with the entity id "${staticDossieraAccountKey}" should be present on the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" with the following values
	| Domain      | salesforce                  |
	| Entity Id   | ${staticDossieraAccountKey} |
	| Entity Name | account                     |
	And the external link with the entity id "${staticSalesforceProjectKey}" should be present on the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" with the following values
	| Domain      | salesforce                    |
	| Entity Id   | ${staticSalesforceProjectKey} |
	| Entity Name | project                       |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken" and the following values
	| Email Address | pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | PRO                                  |
	| Last Name     | Koroneiki1                           |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Liferay Account Customer Role" and the following values
	| Name        | Liferay Account Customer Role |
	| Type        | Account Customer              |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki product with the name "A Liferay DXP Product" and the following values
	| Name | A Liferay DXP Product | |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki product with the name "Platinum Subscription" and the following values
	| Name | Platinum Subscription | |
	And the external link with the entity id "A Liferay DXP Product" should be present on the product "A Liferay DXP Product" with the following values
	| Domain      | salesforce            |
	| Entity Id   | A Liferay DXP Product |
	| Entity Name | product               |
	And the external link with the entity id "Platinum Subscription" should be present on the product "Platinum Subscription" with the following values
	| Domain      | salesforce            |
	| Entity Id   | Platinum Subscription |
	| Entity Name | product               |
	And the contact with the email address "pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" should have the contact role "Liferay Account Customer Role"
	And I should be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki made by the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" for the product "A Liferay DXP Product" with the following values
	| Quantity | 1        | |
	| Status   | Approved | |
	And I should be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki made by the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" for the product "Platinum Subscription" with the following values
	| Quantity | 1        | |
	| Status   | Approved | |

Scenario: Send message with existing product and contact entities
	Testing the ability to create a project in Dossiera and verifying that the existing product and contact entities on Koroneiki get used

	Given I generate several static variables for Provisioning
	And I generate a provisioning company name
	And I generate a provisioning project name
	And I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | PRO                                  |
	| Last Name     | Koroneiki1                           |
	And I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Name        | Liferay Account Customer Role |
	| Type        | Account Customer              |
	And I create a product with the following values
	| Name | A Liferay DXP Product | |
	And I create a product with the following values
	| Name | Platinum Subscription | |
	And I create an external link on a product "A Liferay DXP Product" with the following values
	| Domain      | salesforce            |
	| Entity Id   | A Liferay DXP Product |
	| Entity Name | product               |
	And I create an external link on a product "Platinum Subscription" with the following values
	| Domain      | salesforce            |
	| Entity Id   | Platinum Subscription |
	| Entity Name | product               |
	And I publish a project with no partner RabbitMQ message on sandbox with routing key "dossiera.provisioning.create" with the following values
	| Account Name                           | Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}              |
	| Address City                           | Diamond Bar                                |
	| Address Country                        | United States                              |
	| Address Postal Code                    | 91765                                      |
	| Address Region                         | California                                 |
	| Address Street                         | 456 Fake Street                            |
	| Contact Email Address                  | pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken       |
	| Contact First Name                     | PRO                                        |
	| Contact Last Name                      | Koroneiki1                                 |
	| Contact Role                           | Liferay Account Customer Role              |
	| Dossiera Account Key                   | ${staticDossieraAccountKey}                |
	| Dossiera Address Key 1                 | ${staticDossieraAddressKey1}               |
	| Dossiera Address Key 2                 | ${staticDossieraAddressKey2}               |
	| Dossiera Contact Key                   | ${staticDossieraContactKey}                |
	| Dossiera Project Key                   | ${staticDossieraProjectKey}                |
	| End Day                                | ${staticEndDay}                            |
	| End Month                              | ${staticEndMonth}                          |
	| End Year                               | ${staticEndYear}                           |
	| Industry                               | Automotive                                 |
	| Owner Email Address                    | pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken       |
	| Owner First Name                       | PRO                                        |
	| Owner Last Name                        | Koroneiki1                                 |
	| Partner First Line Support             | false                                      |
	| Product Type                           | New                                        |
	| Product Name                           | A Liferay DXP Product                      |
	| Project Name                           | Korpro - ${staticProjectName}              |
	| Renewal                                | false                                      |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Key             | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityKey}          |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Line Item Key 1 | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityLineItemKey1} |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Line Item Key 2 | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityLineItemKey2} |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Sold By         | Liferay US                                 |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Stage Name      | Closed Won                                 |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Territory       | United States                              |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Type            | New Business                               |
	| Salesforce Owner User Key              | ${staticSalesforceOwnerUserKey}            |
	| Salesforce Project Key                 | ${staticSalesforceProjectKey}              |
	| Start Day                              | ${staticStartDay}                          |
	| Start Month                            | ${staticStartMonth}                        |
	| Start Year                             | ${staticStartYear}                         |
	| Subscription Level                     | Platinum                                   |
	| Version Number                         | 7.1                                        |
	And I wait for "10" seconds
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki account with the name "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" and the following values
	| Code                  | KORPROKORPRO                         |
	| Contact Email Address | pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Name                  | Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}        |
	| Region                | United States                        |
	| Status                | Approved                             |
	And I should be able to view a postal address on koroneiki for the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" with the street address "456 Fake Street" with the following values
	| Country               | United States   |
	| Locality              | Diamond Bar     |
	| Region                | California      |
	| Postal Code           | 91765           |
	| Street Address Line 1 | 456 Fake Street |
	And the external link with the entity id "${staticDossieraAccountKey}" should be present on the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" with the following values
	| Domain      | salesforce                  |
	| Entity Id   | ${staticDossieraAccountKey} |
	| Entity Name | account                     |
	And the external link with the entity id "${staticSalesforceProjectKey}" should be present on the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" with the following values
	| Domain      | salesforce                    |
	| Entity Id   | ${staticSalesforceProjectKey} |
	| Entity Name | project                       |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken" and the following values
	| Email Address | pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | PRO                                  |
	| Last Name     | Koroneiki1                           |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Liferay Account Customer Role" and the following values
	| Name        | Liferay Account Customer Role |
	| Type        | Account Customer              |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki product with the name "A Liferay DXP Product" and the following values
	| Name | A Liferay DXP Product | |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki product with the name "Platinum Subscription" and the following values
	| Name | Platinum Subscription | |
	And the external link with the entity id "A Liferay DXP Product" should be present on the product "A Liferay DXP Product" with the following values
	| Domain      | salesforce            |
	| Entity Id   | A Liferay DXP Product |
	| Entity Name | product               |
	And the external link with the entity id "Platinum Subscription" should be present on the product "Platinum Subscription" with the following values
	| Domain      | salesforce            |
	| Entity Id   | Platinum Subscription |
	| Entity Name | product               |
	And the contact with the email address "pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" should have the contact role "Liferay Account Customer Role"
	And I should be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki made by the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" for the product "A Liferay DXP Product" with the following values
	| Quantity | 1        | |
	| Status   | Approved | |
	And I should be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki made by the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" for the product "Platinum Subscription" with the following values
	| Quantity | 1        | |
	| Status   | Approved | |

